{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "d9f1f3a2-6c7e-4b2a-9d1e-1a2b3c4d5e6f",
    "name": "CIHUY Notification API",
    "description": "Koleksi pengujian API notifikasi CIHUY (backend_cihuy).\n\nCara pakai:\n1. Jalankan backend dari folder backend_cihuy: npm start\n2. Import file ini ke Postman.\n3. Isi Collection Variables: firebaseIdToken, fcmToken, schedulerSecret.\n4. Jalankan GET /health terlebih dahulu.\n   - configured:false berarti kredensial Firebase belum lengkap; endpoint notifikasi akan mengembalikan 503.\n5. Endpoint pengguna memakai Authorization: Bearer <firebaseIdToken>.\n6. Endpoint /internal/dispatch memakai Authorization: Bearer <schedulerSecret>.\n\nCatatan keamanan:\n- Jangan menaruh service-account JSON, Supabase secret key, atau SCHEDULER_SECRET di file collection ini.\n- Backend saat ini memverifikasi Firebase ID token, bukan Supabase access token.\n- Push untuk akun Google belum diaktifkan di aplikasi.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 - Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Cek status backend",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('configured tersedia', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.have.property('configured');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Tidak memerlukan token. Jika configured:false, isi GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT dan GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS di backend_cihuy/.env lalu restart backend."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "01 - API Pengguna",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Daftarkan / perbarui perangkat",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('saved true', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.eql({ saved: true });",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{firebaseIdToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"deviceId\": \"{{deviceId}}\",\n  \"token\": \"{{fcmToken}}\",\n  \"settings\": {\n    \"enabled\": true,\n    \"mode\": \"push\",\n    \"progressTime\": \"{{progressTime}}\",\n    \"motivationTime\": \"{{motivationTime}}\",\n    \"timezone\": \"{{timezone}}\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/device",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "device"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Mendaftarkan perangkat FCM untuk UID pemilik Firebase ID token. deviceId harus UUID 36 karakter; token FCM minimal 20 karakter. Ganti nilai variabel deviceId dan fcmToken dengan data perangkat uji."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Kirim notifikasi uji",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{firebaseIdToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/test",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "test"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Mengirim notifikasi uji ke perangkat milik UID token. Dibatasi sekali per menit per UID. Perangkat harus sudah didaftarkan melalui PUT /v1/device."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Hapus perangkat",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('removed true', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.eql({ removed: true });",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{firebaseIdToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/device/{{deviceId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "device",
                "{{deviceId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Menghapus perangkat milik UID token. Gunakan deviceId yang sama dengan saat pendaftaran."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 - Scheduler Internal",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Jalankan dispatch",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('claimed tersedia', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.have.property('claimed');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{schedulerSecret}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/internal/dispatch",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "internal",
                "dispatch"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Endpoint internal untuk scheduler. Memerlukan SCHEDULER_SECRET minimal 32 karakter dan hanya boleh dipanggil oleh scheduler tepercaya. Jangan membagikan nilai secret ini."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8080",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "firebaseIdToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "fcmToken",
      "value": "GANTI_DENGAN_TOKEN_FCM_PERANGKAT",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "deviceId",
      "value": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "schedulerSecret",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "progressTime",
      "value": "20:00",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "motivationTime",
      "value": "08:00",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "timezone",
      "value": "Asia/Makassar",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ]
}
